 SUMMARY (informational, not legally binding — full AGPL text is the binding doc):

 The AGPL-3.0 license requires that:
 - Modified versions used to provide a service to remote users must release the
   source code of those modifications to those users.
 - Derivative works must use the same license.
 - Patent grant from contributors is included.

 This protects Vọng's open source core from being used as a closed-source SaaS
 without contributing back. Pro tier (proprietary) sold separately via EULA.

